{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44799","headline":"河源破贼後赠袁将军 · 法振","name":"河源破贼後赠袁将军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白羽三千驻，萧萧万里行。\n出关深汉垒，带月破蕃营。\n蔓草河原色，悲笳碎叶声。\n欲朝王母殿，前路驻高旌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"法振","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44799.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44799","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}